{{!< default}}
{{!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     post.hbs — THE DISPATCHER.
     ------------------------------------------------------------------------
     Ghost gives a theme exactly one post.hbs for every post on the site, and
     this site has kinds of post that are genuinely different PAGES. So this
     renders nothing itself: it reads tags and hands off.

     ⚠ BRANCH ORDER IS LOAD-BEARING. The PARENT of each pair is tested before
     its child — #course before #lesson, #training-module before
     #training-lesson — because an overview is not a lesson, and matching the
     lesson branch would render a course overview inside a lesson layout. A
     new branch goes where its SPECIFICITY demands, not at the end.

     THE NAMES ARE abstract/18's, which owns the vocabulary and supersedes the
     older list abstract/02 was written against.

     default.hbs forks on the SAME tags to decide whether the site bar
     appears, because a reading surface must not get a marketing bar. THE TWO
     LISTS MUST STAY IN AGREEMENT.
     ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ --}}

{{#post}}
    {{#has tag="#course"}}
        {{> "post/course"}}
    {{else has tag="#training-module, #docs-section"}}
        {{> "post/section"}}
    {{else has tag="#lesson"}}
        {{> "post/lesson"}}
    {{else has tag="#training-lesson, #docs-page"}}
        {{> "post/training-post"}}
    {{else}}
        {{> "post/blog"}}
    {{/has}}
{{/post}}
